name=Stream Deck Bridge
id=StreamDeckBridge
description=Puts your survivor on an Elgato Stream Deck: health and what the game's Health tab lists for each body part, moodles, the time and weather, your weapon, your load, the car you are in with what the game's Vehicle Mechanics window lists for it (its overall condition and every part's condition), and the character window's Skills, Info, Protection and Temperature tabs (skill levels and progress, profession and traits, bite and scratch defence per body part, and how warm you are as the tab shows it in a normal game), and what the inventory window lists for your main inventory and each bag you wear or hold, read into small files in your Zomboid folder for the Zomboid Deck plugin. In single player it also counts down to the power and water shutoff, using the game's own rule; on a server it says only whether they are on. A few keys can also sit you down, stand you up, switch your flashlight or headlights, start the engine or stop what you are doing, using the game's own actions. Client-side only, no cheats, and nothing leaves your PC. Needs the Zomboid Deck plugin for Stream Deck.
